    "heading": "Tools",
    "lineStart": 7108,
    "lineEnd": 7112
  },
  "section": "6.174",
  "rulesText": "The “Tools” section of “Equipment” lists which tools are required to make certain items. The GM assigns required tools for items not listed there.\n\nYou must use the required tool to make an item and have proficiency with that tool. Anyone who helps you must also have proficiency with it."
}
